This repository includes third-party material:

* crates/cairn-ml/src/clip/  — CLIP text/vision towers vendored from
  candle-transformers 0.11 (https://github.com/huggingface/candle),
  MIT OR Apache-2.0, Copyright the candle authors. Modified: configurable text
  activation (exact GELU), towers loadable separately. See docs/MODELS.md.

* nautilus/vendor/libnautilus-extension/  — public extension API headers from
  GNOME Nautilus 46.4 (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/nautilus),
  LGPL-2.1-or-later, unmodified. Used only to compile the extension, which
  links dynamically against the system libnautilus-extension.

* crates/cairn-gui/fonts/Fraunces.ttf, Nunito.ttf  — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (license texts alongside). Embedded in the cairn-gui binary.

* docs/screenshots/  — contain thumbnails of Wikimedia Commons photos; see
  docs/screenshots/CREDITS.md for authors and licenses.

Models are not included. `cairn models fetch` downloads (MIT-licensed):
  BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (int8 ONNX export by Xenova) and
  laion/CLIP-ViT-B-32-laion2B-s34B-b79K. See docs/MODELS.md.

ONNX Runtime (MIT, Microsoft) is linked statically into cairnd via the `ort`
crate (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
